## 🎨 User Interface

The application contains:

* AI-themed background
* Large title and headings
* Sidebar study settings
* PDF upload card
* Animated generate button
* Generated material card
* Download button
* Responsive Streamlit layout

The interface styling is implemented using custom CSS inside the Streamlit application.

